  "jei.oremygod.change_jade.info": "Change Jade\nObtained from: Change Jade Ore in Ad Astra's lunar_wastelands (needs an End Meteorite Iron pickaxe); or craft from 9 Change Jade Nuggets.\nUsed for: this mod's Change Jade gear, and as a Silent Gear material (gradeable in the Material Grader).\nMelting: melts into Molten Change Jade (gem 100 mB / nugget 11 / block 900 / ore 200) for casting Silent Gear parts.",
  "jei.oremygod.forged_crystal.info": "Forged Crystal\nObtained from: 200 mB Molten Forged Crystal through a Gem Cast, or heated mixing in a Create basin (2 Final Crystal + 2 Forging Additive Ingot).\nUsed for: the only Final-Crystal-family material accepted by Silent Gear gear (parts and finished gear).\nMelting: melts back into 100 mB Molten Forged Crystal.",
  "jei.oremygod.molten_change_jade.info": "Molten Change Jade\nMelting yields: Change Jade 100 mB / nugget 11 mB / block 900 mB / ore 200 mB.\nUsed for: casting Silent Gear parts on a Casting Table or Basin (requires the matching cast from sgearmetalworks).",
  "jei.oremygod.molten_forged_crystal.info": "Molten Forged Crystal\nMade by: 10 mB Molten Final Crystal + 10 mB Molten Forging Additive -> 20 mB (foundry fluid alloying).\nUsed for: (1) 200 mB through a Gem Cast -> Forged Crystal;\n(2) 1000 mB poured onto Silent Gear equipment (the original is consumed) -> every Change Jade part inside is upgraded to a Forged Crystal part, keeping enchantments and custom names."
